# CODEOWNERS — automatic review assignment
#
# GitHub Copilot is requested as a reviewer on every PR automatically.
# This uses your GitHub Copilot Individual subscription — no extra cost.
#
# How it works:
#   - Any PR that touches files matching a pattern below auto-requests
#     the listed reviewer(s).
#   - Copilot posts inline comments and an overall review (approve /
#     request changes) just like a human reviewer.
#   - Copilot's review is advisory: it is NOT a required approval gate
#     (to require it, enable "Require review from code owners" in
#     Settings → Branches → main protection rule).
#
# To add yourself as a second auto-reviewer on all PRs, uncomment the
# last line and replace the handle with your GitHub username.

# All files → request Copilot review on every PR
*   @copilot

# Uncomment to also auto-request yourself:
# *   @scpg
